{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065694/block/singleImage/3277914/df/01M88ZWN1AH1TC5THHSDT6BMG1.jpeg?updatedAt=1795598242\"/><figcaption>六合彩攪珠機。（中通社）</figcaption></figure><p>六合彩幸運二金多寶周二 (11月24日) 攪珠首次推出「集氣加碼頭獎升呢」，金多寶增至5,500萬港元，以10元一注獨中估計頭獎達7,300萬港元，結果無人中頭獎，令金多寶獎金增至約7,553萬元，原定周四 (11月26日) 舉行的攪珠順延至周六 (11月28日) 晚上9時30分進行，並於同晚9時15分截止投注，頭獎一注獨中可得1.02億元。 資料顯示近50次攪珠結果，最熱門號碼為31號（共攪出15次），其次為7號 (共攪出14次)，第三為11號 (共攪出13次)。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:43:56.587709+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":248,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T09:17:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T05:34:41.774601+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T10:37:18.572750+00:00","content_hash":"39bdfdcadb54a204ecbdc4529533874c7fac5bbbfbba38dbd12ac20ef7eb22fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:43:56.587709+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}